{"data":{"id":1400611236,"totalResults":99,"items":[{"quote":"With absolute confidence in its technical execution and in its portrayal of Bond as reckless, rebellious, and full of potential, combined with open maps packed with possibilities for improvisation, 007: First Light may not be a perfect video game (what game is?) but it is the perfect James Bond game, and the one that adds the most to the mythos.","score":100,"url":"https://culturageek.com.ar/review-007-first-light-james-bond-analisis/","date":"2026-05-26","author":"","authorSlug":null,"image":null,"publicationName":"Cultura Geek","publicationSlug":"cultura-geek","reviewedProduct":{"id":1400611236,"type":"games","title":"007 First Light","url":"/game/007-first-light/","criticScoreSummary":{"url":"/game/007-first-light/critic-reviews/?platform=playstation-5","score":87},"platform":{"id":1500000062,"name":"PlayStation 5"},"gameTaxonomy":{"game":{"id":1400611236,"name":"007 First Light"},"platform":{"id":1500000062,"name":"PlayStation 5"}}},"platform":"PlayStation 5"},{"quote":"It would have been expected for IOI to stick to its Silverballers and immediately pump out another Hitman, yet the team swerved by making a Bond game with its own take on the classic British agent. This willingness to take a different path has led to a fresh 007 experience that beautifully marries the liberating sandbox elements of the Hitman series with explosive set pieces typically found in more linear action games.","score":100,"url":"https://comicbook.com/gaming/review/007-first-light-thrilling-action-title-james-bond-games-new-heights-review","date":"2026-05-26","author":"","authorSlug":null,"image":null,"publicationName":"ComicBook","publicationSlug":"comicbook","reviewedProduct":{"id":1400611236,"type":"games","title":"007 First Light","url":"/game/007-first-light/","criticScoreSummary":{"url":"/game/007-first-light/critic-reviews/?platform=playstation-5","score":87},"platform":{"id":1500000062,"name":"PlayStation 5"},"gameTaxonomy":{"game":{"id":1400611236,"name":"007 First Light"},"platform":{"id":1500000062,"name":"PlayStation 5"}}},"platform":"PlayStation 5"},{"quote":"007 First Light is all about aura. It honors James Bond's legacy by\r\nbringing everything we love about him since the 1960's movies in the\r\nultimate 007 videogame experience. Chases, shootings, explosions, plot\r\ntwists, politics, charm, Bond Girls, guns, cars, boats, Q Technologies,\r\nMoneypenny, M, iconic characters, beautiful locations... All of that\r\nwith great level design, combat and exploration. The name is Bond, James\r\nBond.","score":100,"url":"https://meups.com.br/review/007-first-light-vale-a-pena/","date":"2026-05-26","author":"","authorSlug":null,"image":null,"publicationName":"MeuPlayStation","publicationSlug":"meuplaystation","reviewedProduct":{"id":1400611236,"type":"games","title":"007 First Light","url":"/game/007-first-light/","criticScoreSummary":{"url":"/game/007-first-light/critic-reviews/?platform=playstation-5","score":87},"platform":{"id":1500000062,"name":"PlayStation 5"},"gameTaxonomy":{"game":{"id":1400611236,"name":"007 First Light"},"platform":{"id":1500000062,"name":"PlayStation 5"}}},"platform":"PlayStation 5"},{"quote":"007 First Light might just be the best James Bond game ever. The way IOI has translated the Bond fantasy into a 14-hour globetrotting epic is masterful. It's a game full of spectacle, humour, action, and romance. Everything James Bond should be. New Bond owners Amazon must ensure this franchise continues.","score":100,"url":"https://www.videogameschronicle.com/review/007-first-light-review/","date":"2026-05-26","author":"","authorSlug":null,"image":null,"publicationName":"VGC","publicationSlug":"vgc","reviewedProduct":{"id":1400611236,"type":"games","title":"007 First Light","url":"/game/007-first-light/","criticScoreSummary":{"url":"/game/007-first-light/critic-reviews/?platform=playstation-5","score":87},"platform":{"id":1500000062,"name":"PlayStation 5"},"gameTaxonomy":{"game":{"id":1400611236,"name":"007 First Light"},"platform":{"id":1500000062,"name":"PlayStation 5"}}},"platform":"PlayStation 5"},{"quote":"007 First Light is, for me, an absolute masterpiece that shattered all pre-release anxieties and is, in fact, the greatest Bond video game of all time. IO Interactive masterfully balances explosive action with \"Hitman\"-inspired stealth, all brought to life by Patrick Gibson’s breathtaking, definitive performance as a young James Bond. Equal parts thrilling and cinematic, this incredible experience is a gorgeous love letter to the franchise and a sure-fire Game of the Year contender.","score":100,"url":"https://www.gfinityesports.com/article/007-first-light-review","date":"2026-05-26","author":"","authorSlug":null,"image":null,"publicationName":"Gfinity","publicationSlug":"gfinity","reviewedProduct":{"id":1400611236,"type":"games","title":"007 First Light","url":"/game/007-first-light/","criticScoreSummary":{"url":"/game/007-first-light/critic-reviews/?platform=playstation-5","score":87},"platform":{"id":1500000062,"name":"PlayStation 5"},"gameTaxonomy":{"game":{"id":1400611236,"name":"007 First Light"},"platform":{"id":1500000062,"name":"PlayStation 5"}}},"platform":"PlayStation 5"},{"quote":"007 First Light is easily the best James Bond game since GoldenEye and is also one of the better Bond stories told in the last decade. IO Interactive has created a game that is a culmination of all of their best mechanics over the years. 007 First Light has the addicting sandbox gameplay of the Hitman franchise while also having an incredible narrative that matches the quality of Naughty Dog and Rockstar Games. James Bond is finally back and is better than he’s been in years.","score":100,"url":"https://www.vice.com/en/article/007-first-light-review-the-best-james-bond-game-since-goldeneye/","date":"2026-05-26","author":"","authorSlug":null,"image":null,"publicationName":"Vice","publicationSlug":"vice","reviewedProduct":{"id":1400611236,"type":"games","title":"007 First Light","url":"/game/007-first-light/","criticScoreSummary":{"url":"/game/007-first-light/critic-reviews/?platform=playstation-5","score":87},"platform":{"id":1500000062,"name":"PlayStation 5"},"gameTaxonomy":{"game":{"id":1400611236,"name":"007 First Light"},"platform":{"id":1500000062,"name":"PlayStation 5"}}},"platform":"PlayStation 5"},{"quote":"Very few fans get to play in the sandbox of their obsession like IO has here. As far as Bond video games go, nobody has done it better.","score":100,"url":"https://www.theguardian.com/games/2026/may/26/007-first-light-review-james-bond-game-pc-xbox-playstation-5","date":"2026-05-26","author":"","authorSlug":null,"image":null,"publicationName":"Guardian","publicationSlug":"guardian","reviewedProduct":{"id":1400611236,"type":"games","title":"007 First Light","url":"/game/007-first-light/","criticScoreSummary":{"url":"/game/007-first-light/critic-reviews/?platform=playstation-5","score":87},"platform":{"id":1500000062,"name":"PlayStation 5"},"gameTaxonomy":{"game":{"id":1400611236,"name":"007 First Light"},"platform":{"id":1500000062,"name":"PlayStation 5"}}},"platform":"PlayStation 5"},{"quote":"007 First Light delivers everything anyone could want from a game featuring history's most charming secret agent. Whether you're a fan of the franchise or just an action game enthusiast, there is plenty to enjoy here.","score":100,"url":"https://www.omelete.com.br/games/criticas/007-first-light-review-critica","date":"2026-05-26","author":"","authorSlug":null,"image":null,"publicationName":"Omelete","publicationSlug":"omelete","reviewedProduct":{"id":1400611236,"type":"games","title":"007 First Light","url":"/game/007-first-light/","criticScoreSummary":{"url":"/game/007-first-light/critic-reviews/?platform=playstation-5","score":87},"platform":{"id":1500000062,"name":"PlayStation 5"},"gameTaxonomy":{"game":{"id":1400611236,"name":"007 First Light"},"platform":{"id":1500000062,"name":"PlayStation 5"}}},"platform":"PlayStation 5"},{"quote":"007 First Light is, ultimately, a better game for the Bond nerd than I expected it would be. The team at IO Interactive clearly love the property and have done for it what Larian Studios did for Baldur’s Gate 3; provide a level of dedication to the source material that’s so fastidious that you might argue with a decision here or there, but it’s difficult to get too cynical about a game clearly made by genuine fans of the property.","score":100,"url":"https://www.digitallydownloaded.net/2026/06/review-007-first-light-sony-playstation-5.html","date":"2026-06-01","author":"","authorSlug":null,"image":null,"publicationName":"Digitally Downloaded","publicationSlug":"digitally-downloaded","reviewedProduct":{"id":1400611236,"type":"games","title":"007 First Light","url":"/game/007-first-light/","criticScoreSummary":{"url":"/game/007-first-light/critic-reviews/?platform=playstation-5","score":87},"platform":{"id":1500000062,"name":"PlayStation 5"},"gameTaxonomy":{"game":{"id":1400611236,"name":"007 First Light"},"platform":{"id":1500000062,"name":"PlayStation 5"}}},"platform":"PlayStation 5"},{"quote":"007: First Light is not only the best Bond game ever made, it’s also the best Bond story since “Casino Royale” in 2006. ","score":100,"url":"https://www.washingtonpost.com/style/2026/06/03/007-first-light-is-best-james-bond-story-since-casino-royale/","date":"2026-06-03","author":"","authorSlug":null,"image":null,"publicationName":"Washington Post","publicationSlug":"washington-post","reviewedProduct":{"id":1400611236,"type":"games","title":"007 First Light","url":"/game/007-first-light/","criticScoreSummary":{"url":"/game/007-first-light/critic-reviews/?platform=playstation-5","score":87},"platform":{"id":1500000062,"name":"PlayStation 5"},"gameTaxonomy":{"game":{"id":1400611236,"name":"007 First Light"},"platform":{"id":1500000062,"name":"PlayStation 5"}}},"platform":"PlayStation 5"}]},"links":{"self":{"href":"https://back